  "description": "Euro is a lazy god on the verge of disappearing after neglecting his followers for a decade. Now his only hope of survival is his last remaining believer, Allos. So when a dejected Allos begins to doubt Euro's existence and tries to leave his temple for good, Euro descends into the human realm to stop him. However, Allos wants to confirm that Euro is real in a rather unconventional way. Can the forgotten god save himself by satisfying his smitten devotee's steamy requests? \n\n(Source: Tappytoon) \n\n*Note: Part of Luscent's X-mul Danpyeonseon (X물 단편선) Collection.*",
